      "detail": "pub fn key_without_default<T>() -> Key<Option<T>>",
      "documentation": {
        "kind": "markdown",
        "value": "Returns a key whose default is `None`, for a dependency that has no\nsensible default. It must be the whole initializer of a `const`, as\n`key` must (D-1045, D-1565). Through `@std_initializer`, the compiler\nreplaces that one call with a call of `key_without_default_at` (D-1599).\nSo no program reaches this body, which panics as `key`'s does (D-1598)."
      },
